--- !u!114 &674552979
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 674552978}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d8b9da2a7c6e2e40a9b6382b429bd7d3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  beats:
  - title: Why was I left behind?
    text: I was a technology test, built to prove that flight on Mars was possible.
      Like the rover that carried me here, I was never meant to come home.
    voice: {fileID: 0}
    waitForEvent: 0
    showWhileActive: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Why did my mission end?
    text: 'On January 18, 2024, I made my 72nd flight. When I came down, one or more
      of my rotor blades was damaged.


      Try to fly me, the way my team hoped
      I still could.'
    voice: {fileID: 0}
    waitForEvent: 1
    showWhileActive: {fileID: 1648192570}
  - title: Grounded for good
    text: On January 25, 2024, NASA announced that my flying days were over. I was
      planned for 5 flights in 30 days. I flew 72, over almost three years.
    voice: {fileID: 0}
    waitForEvent: 0
    showWhileActive: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Why remember me?
    text: I flew for more than two hours in total and covered about 17 km, 14 times
      farther than planned. I proved that flying is a way to explore other worlds.
      NASA's Dragonfly rotorcraft, headed for Saturn's moon Titan, follows the path
      I opened.
    voice: {fileID: 0}
    waitForEvent: 0
    showWhileActive: {fileID: 0}
  nextLabel: Next
  finishLabel: Return to Earth
  hideButtonOnLastBeat: 0
  onFinished:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls:
      - m_Target: {fileID: 616320405}
        m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: NasaHack.LoadNextScene, Assembly-CSharp
        m_MethodName: Load
        m_Mode: 1
        m_Arguments:
          m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
          m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: 
          m_IntArgument: 0
          m_FloatArgument: 0
          m_StringArgument: 
          m_BoolArgument: 0
        m_CallState: 2
  nextKey: 13
  titleText: {fileID: 1545620314}
  bodyText: {fileID: 2117443035}
  nextButton: {fileID: 1534991832}
  buttonLabel: {fileID: 1671973214}
